  WrittenDialogue: "So I think we learned some really good coping mechanisms to deal with sinful feelings.\nEveryone here loves you and wants you to just make the right decisions.\nAw I just love helping poor kids like you.\nI wish I could reach millions of you but I’m just a lone rehab therapist.\nDon’t lose hope though. The lord has miraculous ways of making dreams come true!"
  DialogueCharacterNames: "KELLY\nKELLY\nKELLY\nKELLY\nKELLY"
